(Section 2: Gradient Descent and Optimization) Tj
T*
(Optimization is the engine of modern neural network training. Gradient descent is an iterative) Tj
T*
(first-order optimization algorithm used to find a local minimum of a differentiable objective function.) Tj
T*
(The algorithm calculates the gradient of the loss function with respect to model weights and updates the) Tj
T*
(weights in the opposite direction of the gradient scaled by a hyperparameter called the learning rate.) Tj
T*
T*
(Variants such as Stochastic Gradient Descent \(SGD\) and Adam are widely used in practice.) Tj
T*
ET
